[I] Multipurpose sniffer/interceptor/logger

[T] ettercap is a multipurpose sniffer for switched LANs. It supports
[T] active and passive dissection of many protocols and includes many
[T] features for network and host analysis.

[U] https://www.ettercap-project.org/

[A] Alberto Ornaghi <alor@users.sourceforge.net>
[A] Marco Valleri <crwm@freemail.it>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network
[F] OBJDIR CROSS

[L] GPL
[V] 0.8.5.1

[D] f5bc0926ff79a56e4f924c4cb8f58665f13d17e68c00f7908cb5b94c ettercap-0.8.5.1.tar.gz https://github.com/Ettercap/ettercap/releases/download/v0.8.5.1/

